t-slate-400 leading-snug\\\">Character intensity + found-family pressure. Matches the prestige drama side of your list.</p>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"card px-3 py-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n                <img src=\\\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dC7jkj2g1aU8sxKqM6D4g44xA6w.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"True Detective\\\" class=\\\"w-16 h-24 rounded-lg object-cover shrink-0 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" />\\n                <div class=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                  <p class=\\\"font-semibold text-sm\\\">True Detective (S1)</p>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\\\">Max / HBO</p>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-xs mt-1.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-snug\\\">You rated it 9. Philosophical + procedural blend — strong atmosphere when you want it.</p>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"card px-3 py-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n                <img src=\\\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fa0RDkAlCec0STeMNAhPaF89q6U.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"There Will Be Blood\\\" class=\\\"w-16 h-24 rounded-lg object-cover shrink-0 bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" />\\n                <div class=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                  <p class=\\\"font-semibold text-sm\\\">There Will Be Blood</p>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\\\">Multiple services</p>\\n                  <p class=\\\"text-xs mt-1.5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-snug\\\">You rated it 9. Power + landscape + character — aligns with your western and prestige leanings.</p>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Streaming synergy -->\\n        <div class=\\\"card p-4 border-l-4 border-l-indigo-500\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 font-medium mb-1\\\">Streaming Synergy</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-sm font-medium\\\">Services that already carry a lot of your 10s / 9s</p>\\n          <ul class=\\\"mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\\\">\\n            <li>• <span class=\\\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">Max / HBO</span> — Chernobyl, True Detective, Band of Brothers adjacent, high-end drama</li>\\n            <li>• <span class=\\\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">Paramount+</span> — Yellowstone universe, 1883, strong western / frontier catalog</li>\\n            <li>• <span class=\\\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">Netflix</span> — Night Agent, several of your thriller and limited-series 10s</li>\\n            <li>• <span class=\\\"font-medium text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200\\\">Disney+</span> — Andor-level prestige + selective classics</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Music -->\\n        <div class=\\\"pt-1\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"cat-pill bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300\\\">Music · Your Lane</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <p class=\\\"font-semibold text-sm\\\">Keep feeding the 2026 favorites list</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\\\">Your current core is strong</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">Bon Iver, Chris Staples, Gregory Alan Isakov, Anna Graves, Sylvan Esso, Caiola, Mazzy Star territory. The Indie Folk / Folk mixes are correctly tuned.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p class=\\\"font-semibold text-sm\\\">Artists to explore next in the same pocket</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">Iron &amp; Wine, The Paper Kites, Lord Huron, Noah Kahan (selective), The Tallest Man on Earth, José González, Fleet Foxes deep cuts. All sit adjacent to what you already play heavily.</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <p class=\\\"font-semibold text-sm\\\">When you want a slight left turn</p>\\n              <p class=\\\"text-xs mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\\\">More atmospheric electronic that still has heart (select Tycho, some Bonobo, or the chill daylist energy you already use) or classic singer-songwriter (deeper Dylan, early Springsteen, Gillian Welch).</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <!-- Visual mood -->\\n        <div>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Mood</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex gap-3 overflow-x-auto pb-1 -mx-1 px-1\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-none w-36 h-24 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514525253161-7a46d19cd819?w=400&q=80\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" alt=\\\"Concert light\\\" />\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n              <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-1.5 left-2 text-white text-[11px] font-medium\\\">Live</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-none w-36 h-24 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?w=400&q=80\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" alt=\\\"Cinema\\\" />\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n              <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-1.5 left-2 text-white text-[11px] font-medium\\\">Cinema</p>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"flex-none w-36 h-24 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative\\\">\\n              <img src=\\\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1493225457124-a3eb161ffa5f?w=400&q=80\\\" class=\\\"img-cover\\\" alt=\\\"Headphones\\\" />\\n              <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent\\\"></div>\\n              <p class=\\\"absolute bottom-1.5 left-2 text-white text-[11px] font-medium\\\">Alone</p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n</div>\"}}}",
