    "jp_lab_ideas_v3": "[{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Personal AI taste recommender\",\"vision\":\"Lightweight agent that learns from what you already save and like and surfaces better next choices. Practice ground for preference memory and agentic retrieval — same muscles as work agents, lower stakes.\",\"synergies\":\"Low-risk training for patterns used in Ajera/Dynamo agents. Keeps the build-agents-that-stick habit alive outside work pressure.\",\"options\":[\"Weekend: export one source and get 10 ranked suggestions\",\"Next: recurring “what should I look at this weekend” prompt\",\"Later: multi-source taste profile that compounds\"],\"bullets\":[\"Pick one source to export this weekend\"]},{\"id\":4,\"title\":\"Quiet process improvements at KM\",\"vision\":\"Ship small undeniable improvements (templates, checklists, sheet standards) before talking about bigger AI ideas. Credibility through output so later agents and Dynamo packs land on trust.\",\"synergies\":\"Creates space for Ajera and Dynamo work to land. Generates reusable artifacts for Salient Land Solutions later.\",\"options\":[\"This month: one high-visibility template that removes repeated pain\",\"Next: a short “how we do X here” note juniors actually use\",\"Later: small internal library that becomes part of your brand\"],\"bullets\":[\"Identify one repeated friction this week\",\"Ship the fix before mentioning AI\"]},{\"id\":5,\"title\":\"Multi-state PE remote consultancy\",\"vision\":\"Long-arc goal: lean remote multi-state PE practice that sells judgment + productized delivery. Tools you build now become leverage and eventual offerings. Financial and schedule autonomy is the point.\",\"synergies\":\"Every automation and process win is both KM value and future product. Idaho PE + Texas foundation + productized workflows = the platform. Command Center is practice for that operating system.\",\"options\":[\"Near term: excel at KM while collecting PE licenses and side artifacts\",\"Mid: selective remote/overflow work under your DBA using your tools\",\"Long: small autonomous practice with agent-assisted delivery\"],\"bullets\":[\"Track Idaho PE status monthly\",\"Note which deliverables repeat across clients\"]}]",
